<title>USA: Household completes Transamerica unit acquisition.</title>
<headline>Household completes Transamerica unit acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>PROSPECTS HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Household International Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of Transamerica Corp's consumer finance business.</p>
<p>Household said in a statement that it expects the acquisition will be accretive to earnings this year, and more so in 1998.</p>
<p>Household provides consumer finance and credit card products in the United States.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
